---
import { Phone } from "@lucide/astro";

const paragraphClass =
  "text-lg md:text-xl mt-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-gray-700 leading-relaxed";
---

<section class="text-center">
  <!-- Heading -->
  <h1
    class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-heading font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight">
    You're losing jobs because<br />you're not calling fast enough
  </h1>

  <!-- Body Text -->
  <p class={paragraphClass}>
    <span class="font-bold text-black">
      We've tested Google Local Services Ads by submitting real customer
      inquiries. In most cases, we never got a call back.
    </span>{" "}
    Automated texts showed up right away, but an actual phone call rarely did. If
    it did, it was the next day. Sometimes 3 days later.
  </p>
  <p class={paragraphClass}>
    Our AI voice agent doesn’t wait. It picks up inbound calls or reaches out to
    new leads within 6 seconds, asks the right questions, and books an estimate
    immediately, while other businesses are still catching up.
  </p>

  <!-- Button -->
  <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center">
    <a
      href="/booking"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-md font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors">
      Book a 15-min free consultation
      <Phone class="w-5 h-5" />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
